  "comments": [
    {"at":0,"placement":"line","text":"Stops the amoeba growth when no amoeba cell had room now but one had room in the scan before. Keeps the amoeba count."},
    {"at":8,"placement":"side","text":"The amoeba becomes diamonds."},
    {"at":32,"placement":"line","text":"Reads fire. When no Rockford is in the cave for 16 scans, the clock ran a second and fire is pressed, it ends the play."},
    {"at":54,"placement":"line","text":"Scans the cave once. Each cell runs the handler of its element or gets the settled code. Then it reads the game keys."},
    {"at":54,"placement":"side","text":"22 rows, or 15 rows for an intermission."},
    {"at":75,"placement":"side","text":"Counts the scans without Rockford, at most 16. The Rockford handler sets it to 0."},
    {"at":99,"placement":"side","text":"High byte of the handler of the element. Zero: no handler."},
    {"at":111,"placement":"side","text":"The handler returns with jmp scan_cell_settle."},
    {"at":114,"placement":"side","text":"Sets the settled code of the element, when the table gives one."}
  ],
